sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant Cache as EventCacheService
    participant Mem as Memory Cache
    participant IDB as IndexedDB
    participant Relay as NOSTR Relay

    Note over App,Relay: Event Storage Flow

    App->>Cache: set(event, options)
    activate Cache
    Cache->>Cache: Validate event (Zod schema)
    Cache->>Cache: Calculate TTL & expiration
    Cache->>Mem: Check memory limit
    alt Memory limit reached
        Mem->>Mem: Evict LRU entry
    end
    Cache->>Mem: Store event + metadata
    Cache->>Mem: Update indexes (pubkey, kind, tags)
    Cache->>Mem: Track access order (LRU)
    opt IndexedDB enabled
        Cache->>IDB: Persist event + metadata
    end
    Cache->>Cache: Update statistics (set count)
    Cache->>Cache: Track operation latency
    Cache-->>App: Success
    deactivate Cache

    Note over App,Relay: Event Retrieval Flow

    App->>Cache: get(eventId)
    activate Cache
    Cache->>Mem: Lookup by ID
    alt Found in memory
        Mem-->>Cache: Return cached event
        Cache->>Cache: Check expiration
        alt Expired
            Cache->>Mem: Delete expired event
            Cache->>IDB: Delete from IndexedDB
            Cache-->>App: null (cache miss)
        else Not expired
            Cache->>Mem: Update access time (LRU)
            Cache->>Cache: Increment hit counter
            Cache-->>App: event (cache hit)
        end
    else Not in memory
        opt IndexedDB enabled
            Cache->>IDB: Lookup by ID
            alt Found in IndexedDB
                IDB-->>Cache: Return cached event
                Cache->>Cache: Check expiration
                alt Expired
                    Cache->>IDB: Delete expired event
                    Cache-->>App: null (cache miss)
                else Not expired
                    Cache->>Mem: Promote to memory cache
                    Cache->>Cache: Increment hit counter
                    Cache-->>App: event (cache hit from IDB)
                end
            else Not found
                Cache->>Cache: Increment miss counter
                Cache-->>App: null (cache miss)
            end
        end
    end
    deactivate Cache

    Note over App,Relay: Query Flow with Filters

    App->>Cache: query(filter)
    activate Cache
    Cache->>Cache: Parse filter criteria
    Cache->>Mem: Use indexed lookup
    alt Filter by IDs
        Mem-->>Cache: Return events matching IDs
    else Filter by authors
        Mem->>Mem: Lookup pubkey index
        Mem-->>Cache: Return author's events
    else Filter by kinds
        Mem->>Mem: Lookup kind index
        Mem-->>Cache: Return events of kind
    else Full scan
        Mem-->>Cache: Return all events
    end
    Cache->>Cache: Apply additional filters (tags, time)
    Cache->>Cache: Check expiration for each
    Cache->>Cache: Sort by created_at DESC
    Cache->>Cache: Apply limit
    Cache->>Cache: Track query latency
    Cache-->>App: Filtered events
    deactivate Cache

    Note over App,Relay: Cache Invalidation on Publish

    App->>Cache: invalidateOnPublish(newEvent)
    activate Cache
    Cache->>Cache: Analyze event type
    alt Replaceable event (kind 0,3,10000-19999)
        Cache->>Cache: Generate patterns
        Note right of Cache: pubkey:{author}<br/>kind:{kind}
        Cache->>Mem: Invalidate matching events
        opt IndexedDB enabled
            Cache->>IDB: Delete matching events
        end
    end
    alt Event references others (e-tags)
        loop For each referenced event
            Cache->>Mem: Delete referenced event
            Cache->>IDB: Delete from IndexedDB
        end
    end
    Cache->>Cache: Update eviction statistics
    Cache-->>App: Invalidation complete
    deactivate Cache

    Note over App,Relay: Automatic Cleanup (Every 5 minutes)

    Cache->>Cache: cleanup() timer fires
    activate Cache
    Cache->>Mem: Scan for expired events
    Mem-->>Cache: List of expired IDs
    loop For each expired event
        Cache->>Mem: Delete event
        Cache->>IDB: Delete from IndexedDB
        Cache->>Cache: Update indexes
        Cache->>Cache: Increment expiration counter
    end
    Cache->>Cache: Update lastCleanup timestamp
    Cache-->>Cache: Cleanup complete
    deactivate Cache
